<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>
  {%- if request.page_type == 'password' -%}
    {{- shop.name -}}
  {%- else -%}
    {{- page_title -}}
    {%- if current_tags %}{% assign meta_tags = current_tags | join: ', ' %} &ndash; {{ 'general.meta.tags' | t: tags: meta_tags }}{% endif -%}
    {%- if current_page != 1 %} &ndash; {{ 'general.meta.page' | t: page: current_page }}{% endif -%}
    {%- unless page_title contains shop.name %} &ndash; {{ shop.name }}{% endunless -%}
  {%- endif -%}
</title>

{%- if canonical_url != blank -%}
  <link rel="canonical" href="{{ canonical_url }}">
{%- endif -%}

{%- if settings.favicon != blank -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign image_type = settings.favicon | split: '?' | first | split: '.' | last | downcase
    if image_type == 'svg'
      assign image_type = 'svg+xml'
    endif
  -%}
  <link rel="icon" href="{{ settings.favicon | image_url: width: 48, height: 48 }}" type="image/{{ image_type }}">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="{{ settings.favicon | image_url: width: 180, height: 180 }}">
{%- endif -%}

{%- if page_description -%}
  <meta name="description" content="{{ page_description | escape }}">
{%- endif -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Accessibility (WCAG 2.1 AA — 1.4.3 Contrast Minimum) safeguard for product overlay badges.
  The merchant badge colours injected via doc-head-styles rendered light text below the
  4.5:1 minimum on the sale, low-stock, and "new" badges (and the sage "meta" badge on US).
  These overrides restore AA-compliant colours in the same hue family. Verified ratios:
    - sale badge:  #cf2f22 bg  -> white 5.14:1 / #faf9f6 4.89:1
    - new badge:   #a85636 bg  -> white 5.19:1 / #faf9f6 4.93:1
    - meta badge:  #566b54 bg  -> white 5.79:1   (US only)
    - low-stock:   dark text #1d1d1d on the amber #f2b321 bg -> 9.03:1
{%- endcomment -%}
<style>
  :root {
    --product-label-overlay-reduction-bg: #cf2f22 !important;
    --product-label-overlay-stock-text:   #1d1d1d !important;
    --product-label-overlay-new-bg:       #a85636 !important;
    --product-label-overlay-meta-bg:      #566b54 !important;
  }
</style>
